  },
  "notes": [
    "Partial MHV1 mapping. Direct copies (category, setting, start time, care unit, LMP) have no confidence. Percents below are the chance that guess is the right slot or value. Bp_comp is a date-time; in Swedish obstetrics bp can mean beräknad partum, and these examples leave it empty."
  ],
  "questions": [
    {
      "text": "Which source date should fill estimated date of delivery?",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "berakforsm, the cycle date",
          "recommended": true
        },
        "berakforul when present, otherwise berakforsm",
        "Also map berakforul and berakforet on their own date elements",
        "Leave EDD unmapped until bp_comp (beräknad partum) is defined"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "How should the composer identifier be filled?",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Name from composer, id from barnmorska, type local",
          "recommended": true
        },
        "Name only",
        "Leave the identifier empty"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Weight has no unit and no measurement time. What should the observation use?",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Units kg, and event time from context/start_time",
          "recommended": true
        },
        "Magnitude only",
        "Leave weight unmapped"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Snus and assessment texts sit on elements whose English labels are unreliable. Keep this placement?",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Keep both snus texts and bedomningtext",
          "recommended": true
        },
        "Snus at enrolment only",
        "Leave snus and assessment unmapped"
      ]
    }
  ],
